Package: harita
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: Harita contributors <hayoloo642@gmail.com>
Depends: libc6
Description: Harita — local-first daily dashboard for Indonesian students
 Harita is a local-first daily dashboard for Indonesian students: tasks,
 calendar, pomodoro, flashcards, habits, expenses, deadlines, weather, and
 device monitoring. It stores all data locally in SQLite; no account or
 cloud service is required.
